[ti:Hark! The Herald Angels Sing]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:30.00]Hark! the herald angels sing
[00:30.67]Glory to the new-born King
[00:31.33]Peace on earth and mercy mild
[01:00.00]God and sinners reconciled
[01:00.67]Joyful all ye nations rise
[01:01.33]Join the triumph of the skies
[01:30.00]With the angelic host proclaim
[01:31.00]Christ is born in Bethlehem
